stateDiagram-v2
    state "running / Ordinary task execution" as running
    state "recovering / Fence, reconcile, restore" as recovering
    state "queued / Return to normal scheduling" as queued
    state "waiting_for_device / Original device unavailable" as waiting
    state "recovery_blocked / Repair resource or structure" as blocked
    state "paused / Pause wins after cleanup" as paused
    state "Terminal / Cancel or unrecoverable failure" as terminal
    running --> recovering: Fault
    recovering --> queued: Ready
    queued --> running: Normal scheduling
    recovering --> waiting: Device unavailable
    waiting --> recovering: Device available
    waiting --> blocked: Wait expires
    recovering --> blocked: Resource or structural issue
    blocked --> recovering: Bounded recheck after repair
    recovering --> paused: Pause requested
    recovering --> terminal: Cancel / unrecoverable required body
